  title: 3) Why are one-sided articles/posts probably fake news?
  answers:
  - They only show one side of the argument.
  - "Because they don\u2019t support my ideology."
  - "Because real news doesn\u2019t cover arguments or opinions."
  - They also present information for the other side of the argument.
